{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"1cb8247d5f854a4cf8801d2e755eeb4f5cc11374c7077a61f19b4ee56e012688","ja":"とっても大事なこと？","zh":"非常重要的事？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"abaa4672b0ca8eea530efc187eeb6c6ce564fb4ecac1c3d4379ee79e2adf7bb8","ja":"その後も、ふたりは一緒に、\nいろいろな場所を巡ったけれど……","zh":"之后，两个人也一起\n走访了许多地方，但是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"71e63237c8408d2451e48b734f0417b8063cb7a4e06de665e29f696baae56ec0","ja":"はあ……。\nやっぱり何も思い出せないです……。","zh":"唉……。\n果然还是什么都想不起来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f6287009a7bf7392dc917d63a92b0bee36e54e50525ef80a50691f22d56a7c33","ja":"本当なら、とことん付き合いたいけど、\n今日中に、コスメを受け取らないといけなくて……。","zh":"虽然按理说很想奉陪到底，\n但今天必须得把化妆品拿到手才行……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"430cb515506e8131fccd8e3df247aca0b4c270520ea252559f313fbf1bebc1a4","ja":"だから、残念だけどそろそろ……ごめんなさい。","zh":"所以，虽然很遗憾，但差不多该……对不起。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e3db2d3d75280f9d24d89399d99d54021d81b50f75cb488ded11ff24d3394dc0","ja":"いえ、そんなっ。一緒に悩んで考えてくれて、\n本当にありがとうございました！","zh":"没、没有的事。能和我一起烦恼、一起思考，\n真的非常感谢您！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"33a2ae443e1630f5a0da120effe4cce94d66748e68255cbead16cf3a0ae5c9bc","ja":"あっ、お店ってどこですか？\n今からでも間に合います？","zh":"啊，店在哪里呀？\n现在去还来得及吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"322872636c2b79b20bea35ce9e26a020cb51faaf1d3ef064ec72c4971cb3c202","ja":"そんなに遠くないから大丈夫よ。\nここから割と近くのデパートだから。","zh":"不会很远的，没关系。\n就在离这里挺近的一家百货商场。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1bd6a0390f902b40bdfe4177e303a6b278eec915ed37f64607ca3f135d476a18","ja":"あ、知ってるところかも。\nあそこだったらすぐ……。","zh":"啊，这地方我可能知道。\n要是那里的话，很快就……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1da7fafc0daadd63b0878c5f7ecef31df1ed572795e0f0af9b824ec35af8d64a","ja":"…………ああっ！","zh":"…………啊啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"7efd8c3008bb51fe3e61d48e95ec3650078c23796a36718cf68e1bce5533e2c0","ja":"なになに！？\nあ、もしかして……！","zh":"怎么了怎么了！？\n啊，难道说……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"287606cd8a5f4843ed482d5355463486d243a15b1787bd9e341a7a27a0177b22","ja":"はい！　思い出しました！　私が忘れてたのって……\n『全国スイーツフェス』でした～っ！","zh":"是的！我想起来了！我忘掉的事……\n是“全国甜点嘉年华”啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d5651722ec6d8e890e68be0fa8f096cb24c0d3e795e9b394664f2836b127d37b","ja":"そのデパート……今、ご当地限定のお菓子が\nいっぱい売られてるみたいで……。","zh":"那家百货商场……现在好像在卖\n很多当地限定的点心……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"28b9380377e5e9ea300066a44a051378faa4eb9b0688583a49f78c9b00faff64","ja":"ああ……ふふ。\nそういうイベント、デパートでよくしてるものね。","zh":"啊……呵呵。\n百货商场确实经常办这种活动呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2d0e00f9196bc48bdce727eb7f92334f1d168708f93c775ec9edc5b394344931","ja":"はい……えっと……す、すみません！\n私ってば、大事なことを忘れてる、なんて言って。","zh":"好的……那个……对、对不起！\n我真是的，居然说自己把重要的事给忘了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"bf935dc75bf226ea8ce15ec99ebb7890a64e5bcf71c72a3f4e3cbb8583b185b3","ja":"まさか……単に、お菓子が\n食べたかっただけだったなんて……うう～……。","zh":"难道……单纯只是想吃\n点心而已吗……呜呜～……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7793e565f5bd131367e3326502a8acc7aac7e7a23522c27154706e20f97b1279","ja":"思い出してスッキリできたから、いいじゃない♪\n目的地が同じなら、このまま一緒に行きましょ？","zh":"既然想起来整个人都舒畅了，不也挺好的嘛♪\n要是目的地一样的话，干脆就这样一起走吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c535c6f15418d4dbe6988ab180dbb2b98215ed719ce6835b1b0bd0c94520842c","ja":"あ……はい！　それじゃあ……。\nおいしそうなお菓子があったら、一緒に食べませんか？","zh":"啊……好的！那……\n要是有看起来很好吃的点心，能和我一起吃吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1743.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"7f1dda08fabc8482f435ea331e9d518a1867013567941cdea94ec56a9a0e59de","ja":"ええ、ぜひ♪\n思い出せたお祝いってことで、楽しみましょ♪","zh":"嗯，好的♪\n就当作是想起来的庆祝，好好享受吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
